[{"answer":"Hi, Ms Harris. Here we are, talking once again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm always willing to help out wherever possible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Is anything troubling you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, your advice last week about writing summaries was very useful,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/4.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm using these summaries a lot in order to prepare my final master's thesis.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/5.mp3"},{"answer":"But you're having problems, right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I have a few issues to discuss.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Obviously I want a good essay, and I want to achieve high marks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/8.mp3"},{"answer":"But I'm not sure on the best way to start.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/9.mp3"},{"answer":"That's an easy question.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Start with a topic, but not one that I necessarily suggest,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/11.mp3"},{"answer":"but one that you want to explore.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/12.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll always write better when doing so on a topic you're interested in,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/13.mp3"},{"answer":"not one imposed upon you by others.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm interested in management theory.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Then pursue that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/16.mp3"},{"answer":"However, that alone is far too broad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Break it into various current areas of discussion and relevance,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/18.mp3"},{"answer":"then look more carefully at one of them -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/19.mp3"},{"answer":"say, management and cultural differences,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/20.mp3"},{"answer":"or management and motivation,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/21.mp3"},{"answer":"or other aspects, such as the role of salary, group cohesion, or leadership.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I would say I'm interested in group cohesion,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/23.mp3"},{"answer":"that is, how people interact in the workplace.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's a start,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/25.mp3"},{"answer":"but you can't then just write planlessly,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/26.mp3"},{"answer":"without defining exactly what you intend to do within the area you've chosen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/27.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll have to think of a thesis, and this statement could be of several types.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Such as what?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, you could argue a point, something that you believe in;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/30.mp3"},{"answer":"or discuss an issue, looking at its various perspectives;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/31.mp3"},{"answer":"or critique the opinions of others, pointing out the pitfalls and flaws.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/32.mp3"},{"answer":"The thesis statement will make that very clear because it will say,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/33.mp3"},{"answer":"in simple terms, what you intend to achieve in your essay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/34.mp3"},{"answer":"I see. And then I can just begin writing, right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Wrong!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/36.mp3"},{"answer":"If your essay is going to be clear, it needs to be logical and organised,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/37.mp3"},{"answer":"and this means you'll need an outline.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/38.mp3"},{"answer":"This could be written as a flowchart, or spider graph,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/39.mp3"},{"answer":"that is, a series of connected lines,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/40.mp3"},{"answer":"but whatever shape the outline takes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/41.mp3"},{"answer":"there must be a sense of progress, in, more or less, a straight line, towards a goal.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/42.mp3"},{"answer":"And then my essay will be good?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/43.mp3"},{"answer":"With such progression, definitely","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/44.mp3"},{"answer":"as long as you do achieve everything that you set out to do,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/45.mp3"},{"answer":"as specified in the beginning, okay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, Ms Harris, your advice about essay writing all sounds very useful:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/47.mp3"},{"answer":"solid, and step by step, so I'll certainly follow that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/48.mp3"},{"answer":"But can you tell me in more general terms,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/49.mp3"},{"answer":"what constitutes the best essay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, there are many aspects to consider,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/51.mp3"},{"answer":"but one of the most important is certainly, original thinking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/52.mp3"},{"answer":"The best essays are written by people who think for themselves,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/53.mp3"},{"answer":"and not just copy or imitate established views.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/54.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I can do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/55.mp3"},{"answer":"But remember, you can't just give a list of unsupported assertions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/56.mp3"},{"answer":"There needs to be support as well -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/57.mp3"},{"answer":"a chain of logic linking each step in your argument.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Right!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Yet that alone is not enough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Your argument may be logically sound, but is it practically so?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/61.mp3"},{"answer":"For that, you need examples, from real-life, to illustrate your points or sub-points.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/62.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got lots of examples from my course readings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/63.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose I could use them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/64.mp3"},{"answer":"But remember, whenever you use an example,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/65.mp3"},{"answer":"or facts or figures that are not commonly known,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/66.mp3"},{"answer":"you must give a reference.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/67.mp3"},{"answer":"That's an academic necessity, without which your writing will automatically fail.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/68.mp3"},{"answer":"So, it's necessary to give these. Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Absolutely! And with that, your essay will be fine,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/70.mp3"},{"answer":"but always ensure that you format it clearly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/71.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you mean?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/72.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean the practical considerations,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/73.mp3"},{"answer":"as written in the university style guide,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/74.mp3"},{"answer":"such as leaving appropriate margins,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/75.mp3"},{"answer":"using double spacing, Arial font, and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/76.mp3"},{"answer":"You see, your writing must look good, as well as be good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/77.mp3"},{"answer":"I can certainly do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/78.mp3"},{"answer":"And, finally, related to the previous point,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/79.mp3"},{"answer":"you need to respect the number of words required.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Your individual lecturers will give you a word-count figure,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/81.mp3"},{"answer":"so follow what they say, making your essay neither too long, nor too short,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/82.mp3"},{"answer":"perhaps 10% either way should be acceptable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/83.mp3"},{"answer":"15% was common when I was younger,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/84.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's a lot stricter now,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/85.mp3"},{"answer":"and 20% would be pushing the boundaries just a little too far.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/86.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess I can do all that. Thanks for your advice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-30-2021-12-27-09-53-48/87.mp3"}]
